@host = http://localhost:5242

##### INNLOGGING / AUTH 

### Admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@brukt.no", "password": "Passord1!" }
> {% client.global.set("admin", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Ola
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ola@brukt.no", "password": "Passord1!" }
> {% client.global.set("ola", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Kari
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kari@brukt.no", "password": "Passord1!" }
> {% client.global.set("kari", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Per
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "per@brukt.no", "password": "Passord1!" }
> {% client.global.set("per", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Hvem er jeg? (id, e-post, navn, roller)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

##### BUD / ANNONSER 

### Kari lager annonse ( 200 )
POST {{host}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{kari}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title":  "FUN Enhjulssykkel", "categoryId": 2, "Condition": "New", "price": 1500 }
> {% client.global.set("oneWheel", response.body.id) %}

### Per gir bud ( 201 )
POST {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{per}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1400 }

> {% client.global.set("perOffer", response.body.id); %}

### Kari byr på egen annonse    ( 400 )
POST {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{kari}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1600 }

### Per byr en gang til mens første bud er Pending  ( 409 )
POST {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{per}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1500 }

### Ola byr under 50% (749 av 1500kr)  ( 400 )
POST {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 749 }

### Ola byr nøyaktig 50% (750kr)   ( 201 )
POST {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 750 }

### Ola prøver å se budene på Karis annonse  ( 403 )
GET {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}

### Kari ser budene på sin annonse  ( 200 )
GET {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{kari}}

### Ola prøver å akseptere  ( 403 )
POST {{host}}/api/offers/{{perOffer}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}

### Kari aksepterer Pers bud  ( 200 )
POST {{host}}/api/offers/{{perOffer}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{kari}}

### Annonsen er nå Sold med SoldPrice og SoldDate
GET {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}

### Olas bud ble automatisk Rejected
GET {{host}}/api/offers/my
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}

### Bud på solgt annonse  ( 409 )
POST {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1700 }

### Kari prøver å endre solgt annonse ( 409 )
PUT {{host}}/api/listings/{{oneWheel}}
Authorization: Bearer {{kari}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "FUN Enhjulssykkel", "price": 2000, "condition": "New", "categoryId": 2 }



###### ANALYSE

### Prisvurdering HØY: iPhone 12 til 25 000 kr
GET {{host}}/api/listings/10

### Prisvurdering LAV: Trek Marlin til 2 500 kr
GET {{host}}/api/listings/23

### Prisvurdering NORMAL: Google Pixel 7
GET {{host}}/api/listings/11

### Prisvurdering UKJENT: Friluft har bare 2 salg
GET {{host}}/api/listings/47



### Prisforslag Sykkel, Good = 6430
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/price-suggestion?categoryId=2&condition=Good
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}

### Prisforslag Friluft = "ikke nok data"
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/price-suggestion?categoryId=4&condition=Good
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}

### Prisforslag uten innlogging  ( 401 )
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/price-suggestion?categoryId=2&condition=Good



### Kategoristatistikk Sykkel
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/categories/2/stats

### Oversikt over alle kategorier
GET {{host}}/api/analytics/overview